  "notes": "Cast rules: the mana rocks first; Caesar as soon as there is another creature for his trigger; Heroic Reinforcements only before combat with three attackers to pump; Wasteland Raider only when the opponents have creatures to give up (everyone sacrifices); then the engines and anthems (Marshal's Anthem among them: Forge's AI never casts it, AI:RemoveDeck:All) and the creatures. The removal, the sweepers, the X spells and the instants stay Forge's. Trigger rule: Caesar's attack trigger (sacrifice another creature: two attacking Soldiers and a burn equal to our tokens, Forge picks those two modes) is taken every time, a token or not (Forge gives up its lowest-rated creature); stock Forge pays for it on under a third of its attacks. Goldfish, same seeds: 10.20 turns. caesar-sinks: the same with two token makers used after combat when the mana is there (Charisma Bobblehead, Memorial to Glory); more tokens are more fodder and more burn for Caesar.",
